  "liner": {
   "body_md": "## What listeners single out\n\n- **Me and My Uncle** (1 review): Me and My Uncle flows into Old Mexico, which is incomplete and sung a cappella [2]\n\n## Setlist highlights\n\n- **Pyramid Country Reprise**: earliest performance in the archive; rare: 3 archived performances [3]\n- **I'm in Hiding**: rare: 3 archived performances [3]\n- **Tinfoil and Turmoil**: earliest performance in the archive; rare: 5 archived performances [3]\n- **Can't You Hear Me Callin**: earliest performance in the archive; legendary: the only archived performance [3]\n- **Muddy Water**: back after 54 archived shows (770 days); rare: 3 archived performances [3]\n- **Billy Addresses the Crowd**: earliest performance in the archive; legendary: the only archived performance [3]\n- Earliest performances in the archive: The Old Home Place [3]\n\n## The recordings\n\n- **BillyStrings2017-08-26.sbd** (recommended): soundboard; 18 songs; 98 min; rated 5/5 by 1 [1]\n\n## Around the show\n\n- Drew Emmitt and Andy Thorn are credited as guests on Old Home Place and most of the later songs, including the encore [2]\n\n## Tapers and lineage\n\n- **BillyStrings2017-08-26.sbd**: taped by Sean Fagan; source: SBD [1]. Also: This recording circulates as a soundboard source, filed as BillyStrings2017-08-26.sbd [2]",
